      "cite": "aluminum",
      "prompt": "描述通过电解还原生产金属铝的过程。",
      "answer": {
        "type": "open",
        "generated_by": "source",
        "solution": "从矿石中提取： $\\text{AlO}(\\text{OH})(s)+\\text{NaOH}(aq)+{\\text{H}}_{2}\\text{O}(l)\\;\\longrightarrow \\;\\text{Na}[\\text{Al}{(\\text{OH})}_{4}](aq)$<br>回收： $\\text{2Na}[\\text{Al}{(\\text{OH})}_{4}](s)+{\\text{H}}_{2}{\\text{SO}}_{4}(aq)\\;\\longrightarrow \\;\\text{2Al}{(\\text{OH})}_{3}(s)+{\\text{Na}}_{2}{\\text{SO}}_{4}(aq)+{\\text{2H}}_{2}\\text{O}(l)$<br>烧结： $\\text{2Al}{(\\text{OH})}_{3}(s)\\;\\longrightarrow \\;{\\text{Al}}_{2}{\\text{O}}_{3}(s)+{\\text{3H}}_{2}\\text{O}(g)$<br>溶于 Na<sub>3</sub>AlF<sub>6</sub>(<em>l</em>) 并电解： ${\\text{Al}}^{3+}+{\\text{3e}}^{-}\\;\\longrightarrow \\;\\text{Al}(s)$"
      }
